cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Business Operations Agent (OpsAgent) in research or teaching, please cite this software."
title: "Business Operations Agent (OpsAgent)"
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Rana
    given-names: Jahanzaib
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0006-7085-0440"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ranajahanzaib/business-operations-agent"
license: MIT
abstract: "OpsAgent is a local-first AI business operations reference system. It gives a configured model provider typed read and proposal tools for a synthetic retail business, pauses proposed state changes at a durable LangGraph checkpoint for human approval, executes approved batches atomically in SQLite with an execution ledger, and independently verifies committed database state against scenario invariants."
keywords:
  - ai-agents
  - human-in-the-loop
  - langgraph
  - operations
  - sqlite
